<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #DDE1FF; border-radius: 20px; padding: 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
<span style="display: inline-flex; width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 14px; background: #F0F2FF; align-items: center; justify-content: center"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#3354FF" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="3" width="16" height="18" rx="2"></rect><line x1="8" y1="8" x2="16" y2="8"></line><line x1="8" y1="12" x2="16" y2="12"></line><line x1="8" y1="16" x2="12" y2="16"></line></svg></span>
<h3 class="h3" style="color: #001C44">The reports look great. Enquiries don't move.</h3>
<p style="margin: 0">Traffic goes up, but the visitors aren't ready to book. I target the searches people make when they need you now.</p>
</div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #DDE1FF; border-radius: 20px; padding: 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
<span style="display: inline-flex; width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 14px; background: #F0F2FF; align-items: center; justify-content: center"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#3354FF" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.5"></circle><path d="M2.5 20c0-3.5 3-6 6.5-6s6.5 2.5 6.5 6"></path><polyline points="16 11 18 13 22 9"></polyline></svg></span>
<h3 class="h3" style="color: #001C44">You hired a strategist and got passed to a junior.</h3>
<p style="margin: 0">Agencies sell with seniors and deliver with whoever's free. With me, the person on your call is the person doing the work.</p>
</div>
<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #DDE1FF; border-radius: 20px; padding: 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
<span style="display: inline-flex; width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 14px; background: #F0F2FF; align-items: center; justify-content: center"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#3354FF" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3l1.8 4.7L18.5 9.5l-4.7 1.8L12 16l-1.8-4.7L5.5 9.5l4.7-1.8z"></path><path d="M19 15l.8 2.2L22 18l-2.2.8L19 21l-.8-2.2L16 18l2.2-.8z"></path></svg></span>
<h3 class="h3" style="color: #001C44">AI answers are picking your competitors.</h3>
<p style="margin: 0">ChatGPT, Perplexity and AI Overviews now decide who gets recommended. I build the signals they look for so they cite you.</p>
